use zeroknowledge latest

coinname save NeedMoreCoin
worktarget save 7237005577332262213973186563042994240829374041602535252466099000494570602496
miningreward save 10
transactionfee save 1
totalsupply save 100

alicesecret save zero knowledge secret make
aliceaddress save alicesecret zero knowledge public make
bobsecret save zero knowledge secret make
bobaddress save bobsecret zero knowledge public make
minersecret save zero knowledge secret make
mineraddress save minersecret zero knowledge public make

alicebalance save 100
bobbalance save 0
minerbalance save 0
alicenonce save 0
bobnonce save 0

show coinname is starting
show Alice wallet address is aliceaddress
show Bob wallet address is bobaddress
show Miner wallet address is mineraddress

genesiscontext save coinname genesis block gives aliceaddress 100 coins
genesismining save 1
genesisattempts save 0
genesiscommitment save 0
genesishash save 0
while genesismining
genesisrandom save zero knowledge nonce make
genesiscandidatecommitment save genesisrandom zero knowledge commitment make
genesiscandidatehash save mineraddress genesiscandidatecommitment genesiscontext zero knowledge challenge make
add 1 to genesisattempts
if genesiscandidatehash is less than worktarget
genesiscommitment save genesiscandidatecommitment
genesishash save genesiscandidatehash
genesismining save 0
end
end

show Genesis block mined after genesisattempts attempts
show Genesis block hash is genesishash

amountone save 25
feeone save transactionfee
nonceone save 1
requiredone save amountone
add feeone to requiredone
contextone save aliceaddress sends amountone coins to bobaddress fee feeone nonce nonceone
proofone save alicesecret contextone zero knowledge proof make
signatureonevalid save aliceaddress proofone contextone zero knowledge verify
transactiononeapproved save 0
if signatureonevalid
if amountone is greater than 0
if alicebalance is greater than or equal to requiredone
if nonceone is equal to 1
transactiononeapproved save 1
end
end
end
end

if transactiononeapproved
subtract amountone from alicebalance
subtract feeone from alicebalance
add amountone to bobbalance
alicenonce save nonceone
end

blockonecontext save coinname block one previous genesishash transaction contextone proof proofone miner mineraddress reward miningreward
blockonemining save transactiononeapproved
blockoneattempts save 0
blockonecommitment save 0
blockonehash save 0
while blockonemining
blockonerandom save zero knowledge nonce make
blockonecandidatecommitment save blockonerandom zero knowledge commitment make
blockonecandidatehash save mineraddress blockonecandidatecommitment blockonecontext zero knowledge challenge make
add 1 to blockoneattempts
if blockonecandidatehash is less than worktarget
blockonecommitment save blockonecandidatecommitment
blockonehash save blockonecandidatehash
blockonemining save 0
end
end

if transactiononeapproved
add miningreward to minerbalance
add feeone to minerbalance
add miningreward to totalsupply
end

show Block one mined after blockoneattempts attempts
show Block one hash is blockonehash

amounttwo save 7
feetwo save transactionfee
noncetwo save 1
requiredtwo save amounttwo
add feetwo to requiredtwo
contexttwo save bobaddress sends amounttwo coins to aliceaddress fee feetwo nonce noncetwo
prooftwo save bobsecret contexttwo zero knowledge proof make
signaturetwovalid save bobaddress prooftwo contexttwo zero knowledge verify
transactiontwoapproved save 0
if signaturetwovalid
if amounttwo is greater than 0
if bobbalance is greater than or equal to requiredtwo
if noncetwo is equal to 1
transactiontwoapproved save 1
end
end
end
end

if transactiontwoapproved
subtract amounttwo from bobbalance
subtract feetwo from bobbalance
add amounttwo to alicebalance
bobnonce save noncetwo
end

blocktwocontext save coinname block two previous blockonehash transaction contexttwo proof prooftwo miner mineraddress reward miningreward
blocktwomining save transactiontwoapproved
blocktwoattempts save 0
blocktwocommitment save 0
blocktwohash save 0
while blocktwomining
blocktworandom save zero knowledge nonce make
blocktwocandidatecommitment save blocktworandom zero knowledge commitment make
blocktwocandidatehash save mineraddress blocktwocandidatecommitment blocktwocontext zero knowledge challenge make
add 1 to blocktwoattempts
if blocktwocandidatehash is less than worktarget
blocktwocommitment save blocktwocandidatecommitment
blocktwohash save blocktwocandidatehash
blocktwomining save 0
end
end

if transactiontwoapproved
add miningreward to minerbalance
add feetwo to minerbalance
add miningreward to totalsupply
end

show Block two mined after blocktwoattempts attempts
show Block two hash is blocktwohash

verifyone save aliceaddress proofone contextone zero knowledge verify
verifytwo save bobaddress prooftwo contexttwo zero knowledge verify
verifygenesishash save mineraddress genesiscommitment genesiscontext zero knowledge challenge make
verifyblockonehash save mineraddress blockonecommitment blockonecontext zero knowledge challenge make
verifyblocktwohash save mineraddress blocktwocommitment blocktwocontext zero knowledge challenge make
chainvalid save 0
if verifyone
if verifytwo
if verifygenesishash is equal to genesishash
if verifygenesishash is less than worktarget
if verifyblockonehash is equal to blockonehash
if verifyblockonehash is less than worktarget
if verifyblocktwohash is equal to blocktwohash
if verifyblocktwohash is less than worktarget
chainvalid save 1
end
end
end
end
end
end
end
end

if chainvalid
show Entire blockchain verified successfully
end

tamperedcontext save aliceaddress sends 250 coins to bobaddress fee feeone nonce nonceone
tamperedsignaturevalid save aliceaddress proofone tamperedcontext zero knowledge verify
tamperedblockcontext save coinname block one previous genesishash transaction tamperedcontext proof proofone miner mineraddress reward miningreward
tamperedblockhash save mineraddress blockonecommitment tamperedblockcontext zero knowledge challenge make
if tamperedsignaturevalid is equal to false
show Signature rejected the changed transaction amount
end
if tamperedblockhash is not equal to blockonehash
show Block hash rejected the changed transaction amount
end

replayexpectednonce save alicenonce
add 1 to replayexpectednonce
if nonceone is not equal to replayexpectednonce
show Transaction nonce rejected replay of the same transaction
end

balancesum save alicebalance
add bobbalance to balancesum
add minerbalance to balancesum
show Alice final balance is alicebalance coins
show Bob final balance is bobbalance coins
show Miner final balance is minerbalance coins
show Total supply is totalsupply coins
show Sum of balances is balancesum coins
if balancesum is equal to totalsupply
show Monetary supply verification succeeded
end
